.TH CITERATORS 7 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Overview"
.SH NAME
CITERATORS \- overview of the citerators API
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Automatically included by cvector.h, chashmap.h, and cbstmap.h.  Any
translation unit that includes one of those container headers gets this entire
API without an additional #include.  Use #include <ccollections.h> to pull in
all three containers and the iteration API together.
